Package: magreport
Title: Explore and Report MAG Recovery Results
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Antonio", "Puriel Hernández", email = "apurielh@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-7631-1102"))
Description: Reads the output tables of the mag-pipeline metagenomics workflow
    (assembly statistics, read mapping, bin statistics, CheckM2 quality and
    GTDB-Tk taxonomy) into tidy data frames, and summarises MAG recovery
    following the MIMAG quality standards.
