Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    rlang
Suggests: 
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/AntonioPuriel/magreport
